1
00:00:01,845 --> 00:00:02,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my God!</font>

2
00:00:02,929 --> 00:00:05,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">The sky ate Greg!</font>

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">How can you calmly
do housework</font>

4
00:00:07,386 --> 00:00:08,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">when there's
a hurricane outside?</font>

5
00:00:08,929 --> 00:00:10,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm stuck inside
all day anyway.</font>

6
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:13,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Might as well scratch some
things off my "to do" list:</font>

7
00:00:13,303 --> 00:00:15,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">install this light fixture,
repair the table,</font>

8
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">find my old
college javelin.</font>

9
00:00:17,428 --> 00:00:19,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why on earth would you
ever need that?</font>

10
00:00:19,553 --> 00:00:21,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">You never know.</font>

11
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:25,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, this weather
is worrying me.</font>

12
00:00:26,012 --> 00:00:27,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you sure
we shouldn't evacuate?</font>

13
00:00:27,803 --> 00:00:28,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">Evacuate?</font>

14
00:00:28,929 --> 00:00:30,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm not going to
abandon my house</font>

15
00:00:30,553 --> 00:00:32,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">just so a bunch of guys
in sports jerseys</font>

16
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">can loot the place and do
God-knows-what with…</font>

17
00:00:34,511 --> 00:00:37,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">my old college javelin.</font>

18
00:00:38,887 --> 00:00:41,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">But we're in Lower Langley.</font>

19
00:00:41,054 --> 00:00:43,303
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>And</i> we're in the lowest part
of the neighborhood!</font>

20
00:00:43,345 --> 00:00:46,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why so many soccer balls
end up in our yard.</font>

21
00:00:50,179 --> 00:00:51,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll be fine.</font>

22
00:00:51,845 --> 00:00:54,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've got us totally prepared
to ride out the storm.</font>

23
00:00:54,179 --> 00:00:56,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">But what if
the sea wall breaks?
Greg said that…</font>

24
00:00:56,595 --> 00:00:58,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Francine, a man's
most important duty</font>

25
00:00:58,762 --> 00:00:59,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">is to protect his family.</font>

26
00:01:00,012 --> 00:01:01,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">So, please, just trust me.</font>

27
00:01:01,929 --> 00:01:04,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">I won't let anything
happen to you guys. Okay?</font>

28
00:01:04,095 --> 00:01:05,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mm, okay…</font>

29
00:01:05,678 --> 00:01:07,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">Try to relax.</font>

30
00:01:07,179 --> 00:01:09,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Watching all that news is
just making you paranoid.</font>

31
00:01:09,261 --> 00:01:11,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe a nice massage
will calm you down.</font>

32
00:01:11,303 --> 00:01:13,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just start up here.</font>

33
00:01:13,470 --> 00:01:14,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">Check it out!</font>

34
00:01:14,970 --> 00:01:17,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got full blueprints
of our house for my project.</font>

35
00:01:17,345 --> 00:01:19,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Junior Architect Society</font>

36
00:01:19,511 --> 00:01:21,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">isn't going to know
what hit them!</font>

37
00:01:21,179 --> 00:01:24,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you allergic to
vaginas, Steve?</font>

38
00:01:27,386 --> 00:01:29,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jeff, what if the
sea wall breaks?</font>

39
00:01:29,345 --> 00:01:31,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">The zoo is in Lower Langley.</font>

40
00:01:31,179 --> 00:01:32,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What about the animals?</font>

41
00:01:32,970 --> 00:01:34,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh, don't worry, babe.</font>

42
00:01:34,678 --> 00:01:36,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">All the animals will
take care of each other,</font>

43
00:01:36,762 --> 00:01:38,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">just like they do
in the wild.</font>

44
00:01:38,970 --> 00:01:40,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know what
I'd do without you.</font>

45
00:01:40,929 --> 00:01:42,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're my rock.</font>

46
00:01:42,220 --> 00:01:43,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on.
Let's go get high</font>

47
00:01:43,803 --> 00:01:45,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">and talk about
other times we got high.</font>

48
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:49,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">Last night was magical.</font>

49
00:01:49,803 --> 00:01:51,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think we could
really have something.</font>

50
00:01:51,762 --> 00:01:54,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, yeah, yeah…</font>

51
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:56,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, say, could I get
that sweatshirt back from you?</font>

52
00:01:56,678 --> 00:01:58,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looks pretty
nasty out there.</font>

53
00:01:58,179 --> 00:01:59,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe I could
just wear it</font>

54
00:01:59,845 --> 00:02:01,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">and give it back
to you next time?</font>

55
00:02:01,595 --> 00:02:03,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah… it's just,</font>

56
00:02:03,303 --> 00:02:06,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">it's kinda my favorite,
you know, from college.</font>

57
00:02:06,303 --> 00:02:07,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll wash it for you.</font>

58
00:02:07,803 --> 00:02:09,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just want to wear
it for a while.</font>

59
00:02:13,137 --> 00:02:14,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">It smells like us.</font>

60
00:02:19,095 --> 00:02:21,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">If you've seen this man, please
call the station right away.</font>

61
00:02:21,970 --> 00:02:25,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">He was last seen being sucked
into the sky, where he belongs.</font>

62
00:02:25,345 --> 00:02:27,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because he's an angel!</font>

63
00:02:31,511 --> 00:02:34,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, Buckle.
Stan, you're
still here?</font>

64
00:02:34,137 --> 00:02:36,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everyone in the
neighborhood has evacuated.</font>

65
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:39,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even my friends Julius
and Rachel Epstein left.</font>

66
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:41,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're beavers, Stan!</font>

67
00:02:41,261 --> 00:02:44,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">I appreciate the concern,
Buckle, but we'll be fine.</font>

68
00:02:44,303 --> 00:02:46,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">The roads
aren't passable anymore,</font>

69
00:02:46,261 --> 00:02:48,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">but I've got
an amphibious vehicle!</font>

70
00:02:48,762 --> 00:02:52,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to get Shari, and
we'll stop by on our way out.</font>

71
00:02:52,095 --> 00:02:55,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">I pray you come
with us, my friend.</font>

72
00:02:59,179 --> 00:03:02,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan, are you sure
we shouldn't go with them?</font>

73
00:03:02,386 --> 00:03:04,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">The sea wall could break
any minute.</font>

74
00:03:04,303 --> 00:03:06,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">For the last time,
we'll be fine.</font>

75
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:07,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have weeks of supplies,</font>

76
00:03:07,637 --> 00:03:09,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the house is
completely watertight.</font>

77
00:03:09,054 --> 00:03:10,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">How do you know that?</font>

78
00:03:10,637 --> 00:03:12,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">Remember when everyone
was worried about anthrax</font>

79
00:03:12,678 --> 00:03:14,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">and dirty bombs a few years ago,</font>

80
00:03:14,428 --> 00:03:16,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">even though they should be far,
far more worried about it now…</font>

81
00:03:16,970 --> 00:03:19,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">trust me I know
what I'm talking about?
I remember.</font>

82
00:03:19,137 --> 00:03:21,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, I everything-proofed
the house.</font>

83
00:03:21,303 --> 00:03:23,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's sealed against anthrax,
radiation, water…</font>

84
00:03:23,970 --> 00:03:26,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">This dumb bastard's going
to get us all killed!</font>

85
00:03:26,428 --> 00:03:27,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have to evacuate!</font>

86
00:03:27,762 --> 00:03:29,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">We are staying
right here!</font>

87
00:03:29,678 --> 00:03:32,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">"Not I," said the guy
who lived, and was beautiful.</font>

88
00:03:32,762 --> 00:03:34,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going with
Red Beard Raccoon Coat.</font>

89
00:03:34,762 --> 00:03:36,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Anyone who's interested
in living</font>

90
00:03:36,345 --> 00:03:38,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">and not being stupid
and crazy,</font>

91
00:03:38,095 --> 00:03:39,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">I suggest you join me.</font>

92
00:03:39,345 --> 00:03:41,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">And anyone who
trusts <i>my</i> judgment</font>

93
00:03:41,220 --> 00:03:42,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">as the protector
of this family,</font>

94
00:03:42,553 --> 00:03:44,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">I suggest you join <i>me!</i></font>

95
00:03:46,887 --> 00:03:48,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Francine?</font>

96
00:03:48,303 --> 00:03:50,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm sorry, Stan.</font>

97
00:03:50,137 --> 00:03:53,469
<font color="#FFFFFF">But when there's a crisis,
you make bad decisions.</font>

98
00:03:53,470 --> 00:03:55,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">They sound reasonable
in the moment,</font>

99
00:03:55,553 --> 00:03:56,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">but they…</font>

100
00:03:56,762 --> 00:03:59,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">always…
end badly.</font>

101
00:03:59,637 --> 00:04:00,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's ridiculous!</font>

102
00:04:00,803 --> 00:04:02,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know it's hard
to hear, Stan,</font>

103
00:04:02,803 --> 00:04:03,845
<font color="#FFFFFF">but it's true.</font>

104
00:04:03,887 --> 00:04:05,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on, kids.</font>

105
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:07,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm with Mommy!
Betrayal!</font>

106
00:04:07,511 --> 00:04:09,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have to stay, Mom.</font>

107
00:04:09,595 --> 00:04:11,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">If the zoo floods,
I need to be here,</font>

108
00:04:11,386 --> 00:04:12,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">so I can start rescuing animals.</font>

109
00:04:12,929 --> 00:04:15,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Besides, I-I think the house
will probably hold.</font>

110
00:04:15,762 --> 00:04:17,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm with you, babe.</font>

111
00:04:17,137 --> 00:04:18,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">See what a good wife
Jeff is, Francine?</font>

112
00:04:19,012 --> 00:04:20,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">He sticks by <i>her</i> husband.</font>

113
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll stay
with you, Roger.</font>

114
00:04:23,012 --> 00:04:24,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're still here?</font>

115
00:04:28,054 --> 00:04:30,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on, you guys!</font>

116
00:04:30,054 --> 00:04:32,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">How can you trust that guy
over me, your own husband?</font>

117
00:04:32,970 --> 00:04:34,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're not giving me
any choice!</font>

118
00:04:34,929 --> 00:04:37,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Staying here
is a perfect example</font>

119
00:04:37,553 --> 00:04:40,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">of you making
a bad crisis decision.</font>

120
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:43,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">I still don't understand why we
couldn't have taken the Solara!</font>

121
00:04:43,845 --> 00:04:47,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Solara is not amphibious,
my sweet Semitic treasure!</font>

122
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:50,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Francine, staying here
is not a bad decision.</font>

123
00:04:50,261 --> 00:04:51,205
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've prepared
for this…</font>

124
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:53,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">I finally did it.</font>

125
00:04:53,595 --> 00:04:54,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've made my decision</font>

126
00:04:54,678 --> 00:04:56,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">about whether to stay or go.</font>

127
00:04:56,386 --> 00:04:58,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">It took a lot of soul searching,</font>

128
00:04:58,261 --> 00:04:59,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">but in the end…</font>

129
00:04:59,345 --> 00:05:00,288
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shut up, Klaus!</font>

130
00:05:00,303 --> 00:05:01,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Punt!</font>

131
00:05:01,845 --> 00:05:03,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hayley, please
come with us.</font>

132
00:05:04,012 --> 00:05:05,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't, Mom.</font>

133
00:05:05,303 --> 00:05:08,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">What of… the animals?</font>

134
00:05:08,428 --> 00:05:10,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why, why, why, why</font>

135
00:05:10,054 --> 00:05:12,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">do you have to
say it like that?</font>

136
00:05:12,345 --> 00:05:13,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">No…!</font>

137
00:05:13,637 --> 00:05:15,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">The sea wall has broken!</font>

138
00:05:23,054 --> 00:05:25,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">What an exciting
first date!</font>

139
00:05:25,386 --> 00:05:27,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're not dating,
you miserable cow!</font>

140
00:05:27,511 --> 00:05:29,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're funny!</font>

141
00:05:29,637 --> 00:05:31,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh… my God.</font>

142
00:05:36,137 --> 00:05:38,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Buckle and Shari!</font>

143
00:05:38,054 --> 00:05:39,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're dead.</font>

144
00:05:39,678 --> 00:05:41,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">Nothing we can
do now but pray</font>

145
00:05:41,095 --> 00:05:43,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">and strip all the copper piping
out of their house.</font>

146
00:05:43,428 --> 00:05:46,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">If you'd gotten in that vehicle,
you'd be dead, too, Francine.</font>

147
00:05:46,303 --> 00:05:48,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">If we'd left this
morning, like I wanted,</font>

148
00:05:48,678 --> 00:05:50,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">we'd be safe at Mah Mah
and Bah Bah's right now!</font>

149
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're safe here!</font>

150
00:05:51,762 --> 00:05:53,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">The generator's working.</font>

151
00:05:53,386 --> 00:05:56,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">The place is sealed tighter than
an unlubricated Komzel valve.</font>

152
00:05:56,054 --> 00:05:58,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">Or maybe the more obvious joke:</font>

153
00:05:58,179 --> 00:06:01,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">a Zwanzi tribesman's nook-nook
ribbon, pre-Lonzi ritual.</font>

154
00:06:03,012 --> 00:06:05,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">Um, Dad…
You didn't seal the drainage</font>

155
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:08,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">that allows water to pass
under the house, did you?</font>

156
00:06:08,179 --> 00:06:09,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">'Cause without that,
the water'll put</font>

157
00:06:09,637 --> 00:06:10,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">too much pressure
on the structure…</font>

158
00:06:10,762 --> 00:06:12,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Steve, stop it.
Just because</font>

159
00:06:12,303 --> 00:06:13,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">you're in an architect club
doesn't mean…</font>

160
00:06:13,762 --> 00:06:16,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hiya, Barb!
Some weather, huh?</font>

161
00:06:16,303 --> 00:06:17,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">…doesn't mean you know
everything about…</font>

162
00:06:17,803 --> 00:06:18,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, Principal Lewis!</font>

163
00:06:18,929 --> 00:06:22,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">End of days… bitches!</font>

164
00:06:24,220 --> 00:06:27,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">…about this house…</font>

165
00:06:27,095 --> 00:06:29,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're moving. The house
is moving. I see that now.</font>

166
00:06:33,012 --> 00:06:34,845
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just as I suspected!</font>

167
00:06:34,887 --> 00:06:36,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">The water couldn't
pass under the house,</font>

168
00:06:36,637 --> 00:06:38,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">so it pushed it
off the foundation!</font>

169
00:06:38,386 --> 00:06:39,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">See, Stan?</font>

170
00:06:39,678 --> 00:06:42,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sealing up the house
and staying here</font>

171
00:06:42,095 --> 00:06:45,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">sounded like okay decisions,
but look what happened!</font>

172
00:06:45,095 --> 00:06:47,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">I feel so close to you.</font>

173
00:06:47,595 --> 00:06:50,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's go look at
your baby pictures.</font>

174
00:06:50,345 --> 00:06:52,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Great, you go get them.
They're outside.</font>

175
00:06:52,261 --> 00:06:54,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where?
Just… outside.</font>

176
00:06:54,845 --> 00:06:57,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">Anywhere. Just go find
them. It's a game.</font>

177
00:06:57,137 --> 00:06:58,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">I say we go up to
the attic…</font>

178
00:06:58,803 --> 00:07:00,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">the highest, safest part
of the house.</font>

179
00:07:00,553 --> 00:07:02,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">We should stay down here.</font>

180
00:07:02,386 --> 00:07:04,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">If rescue comes, we can climb
right out the window</font>

181
00:07:05,012 --> 00:07:06,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">and onto the boat.</font>

182
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:07,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know what?
Fine.</font>

183
00:07:07,595 --> 00:07:10,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">Anyone smart or loyal enough
to take my side in this,</font>

184
00:07:10,637 --> 00:07:11,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">come with me to the attic.</font>

185
00:07:14,845 --> 00:07:16,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hayley, don't listen
to him!</font>

186
00:07:16,762 --> 00:07:18,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">She's made up
her mind, Francine.</font>

187
00:07:18,179 --> 00:07:20,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just like how I normally
make up your mind.</font>

188
00:07:25,179 --> 00:07:27,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">Penny for your thoughts?</font>

189
00:07:27,137 --> 00:07:28,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't have any change.</font>

190
00:07:28,345 --> 00:07:29,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Saucy.
Shut up.</font>

191
00:07:30,012 --> 00:07:31,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do not pass go.
What?</font>

192
00:07:31,762 --> 00:07:34,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Chicken butt.
I hate you.</font>

193
00:07:34,054 --> 00:07:36,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Got your nose!</font>

194
00:07:39,470 --> 00:07:41,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan, what
are you doing?</font>

195
00:07:41,595 --> 00:07:43,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm dropping an anchor
to stop us.</font>

196
00:07:43,428 --> 00:07:45,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">We could crash into something
and sink!</font>

197
00:07:45,220 --> 00:07:47,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, please don't do that!</font>

198
00:07:47,428 --> 00:07:50,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know an anchor sounds like
a good plan.</font>

199
00:07:50,137 --> 00:07:53,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't poke any holes in it,
per se.</font>

200
00:07:53,179 --> 00:07:56,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">But based on your history…</font>

201
00:07:56,386 --> 00:07:58,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">My wine fridge!</font>

202
00:07:58,220 --> 00:07:59,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">I had my cocaine in there!</font>

203
00:08:03,595 --> 00:08:05,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">See, Francine!</font>

204
00:08:05,595 --> 00:08:07,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">It <i>was</i> a good idea,
and it worked!</font>

205
00:08:07,637 --> 00:08:09,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thanks to me,
the Smith family is safe!</font>

206
00:08:25,845 --> 00:08:28,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll never forget you, Roger!</font>

207
00:08:28,386 --> 00:08:29,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just ignore her.</font>

208
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">No…!</font>

209
00:08:32,345 --> 00:08:34,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">My sweatshirt!</font>

210
00:08:36,762 --> 00:08:37,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't worry.
I can fix this.</font>

211
00:08:41,470 --> 00:08:42,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's jammed!</font>

212
00:08:42,970 --> 00:08:45,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ha! Tables have
turned, bitches!</font>

213
00:08:45,428 --> 00:08:47,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">This whole house
is going to flood.</font>

214
00:08:47,345 --> 00:08:49,845
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tough luck for you dicks
who don't have gills.</font>

215
00:08:49,887 --> 00:08:51,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">I guess it's my house now,</font>

216
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:54,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">and I can go wherever I want!</font>

217
00:08:55,970 --> 00:08:58,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">See you never, goat-!</font>

218
00:09:00,179 --> 00:09:02,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is salt water!</font>

219
00:09:02,511 --> 00:09:03,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">It burns!</font>

220
00:09:03,803 --> 00:09:06,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">Put me back, put me back!</font>

221
00:09:08,428 --> 00:09:09,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whew!</font>

222
00:09:09,845 --> 00:09:13,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">So…</font>

223
00:09:13,595 --> 00:09:18,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">a lot of funny jokes
happened just now, <i>ja?</i></font>

224
00:09:18,511 --> 00:09:20,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're completely
upside down!</font>

225
00:09:20,428 --> 00:09:22,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">Aw, look Steve.</font>

226
00:09:22,428 --> 00:09:24,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our glow-in-the-dark
star stickers are still here.</font>

227
00:09:24,970 --> 00:09:27,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Remember that night we camped
out in the living room?</font>

228
00:09:27,303 --> 00:09:29,845
<font color="#FFFFFF">We told ghost stories and you
had your first big-boy dream?</font>

229
00:09:29,887 --> 00:09:31,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Such volume!</font>

230
00:09:32,678 --> 00:09:34,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">That must be the others,
in the attic!</font>

231
00:09:34,345 --> 00:09:35,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have to help them!</font>

232
00:09:35,511 --> 00:09:37,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hmm. Looks like
we can use</font>

233
00:09:37,261 --> 00:09:39,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">this vertical access
shaft to get down there.</font>

234
00:09:39,428 --> 00:09:41,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Those are the
stairs, Steve.</font>

235
00:09:41,345 --> 00:09:43,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">We need to make
some kind of rope…</font>

236
00:09:43,386 --> 00:09:44,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">maybe out of curtains.</font>

237
00:09:44,637 --> 00:09:45,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">As if!</font>

238
00:09:45,970 --> 00:09:47,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">You think I'm gonna risk
my neck for Stan,</font>

239
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">after what he did
to my wine fridge?</font>

240
00:09:48,845 --> 00:09:50,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way!</font>

241
00:09:50,054 --> 00:09:52,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">But… what about your wigs?</font>

242
00:09:52,595 --> 00:09:53,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're all in the attic.</font>

243
00:09:53,970 --> 00:09:56,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get out of my way!
I'll kill you!</font>

244
00:09:59,553 --> 00:10:02,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Franny… we need
to make…</font>

245
00:10:02,054 --> 00:10:03,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">some kind of rope</font>

246
00:10:03,511 --> 00:10:04,845
<font color="#FFFFFF">perhaps…</font>

247
00:10:04,887 --> 00:10:06,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">out of curtains.</font>

248
00:10:06,678 --> 00:10:08,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">I couldn't get
the window shut!</font>

249
00:10:08,345 --> 00:10:09,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">The water is rising!</font>

250
00:10:09,595 --> 00:10:11,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll get us
out of this!</font>

251
00:10:13,845 --> 00:10:16,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm… not gonna
make it, babe!</font>

252
00:10:16,137 --> 00:10:19,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">I-I want you
to take my Hacky Sack…</font>

253
00:10:19,054 --> 00:10:22,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">and-and give it to our
grandchildren.</font>

254
00:10:22,137 --> 00:10:23,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jeff, we don't
even have kids.</font>

255
00:10:23,511 --> 00:10:24,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know.</font>

256
00:10:25,012 --> 00:10:26,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why…
I want you to…</font>

257
00:10:26,845 --> 00:10:28,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">take this folded-up
candy wrapper.</font>

258
00:10:28,553 --> 00:10:30,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't ask me
how I did it.</font>

259
00:10:30,428 --> 00:10:33,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just take it
and start our family.</font>

260
00:10:33,845 --> 00:10:36,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looks like this corridor
should take us</font>

261
00:10:36,137 --> 00:10:38,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">directly to the
main attic access.</font>

262
00:10:38,095 --> 00:10:40,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not a corridor,
it's a hallway!</font>

263
00:10:40,678 --> 00:10:42,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">You need to stop with
the architect jargon.</font>

264
00:10:42,929 --> 00:10:44,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Seriously.
Look at me.</font>

265
00:10:44,762 --> 00:10:48,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">You need to zip it, lock it
and put it in your pocket.</font>

266
00:10:48,386 --> 00:10:49,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan?</font>

267
00:10:49,803 --> 00:10:50,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's Mom!</font>

268
00:10:51,012 --> 00:10:52,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">She's gonna save us!</font>

269
00:10:52,261 --> 00:10:53,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">We don't need saving.</font>

270
00:10:53,470 --> 00:10:54,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've got this under control.</font>

271
00:10:54,929 --> 00:10:57,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm here, Francine!
Don't panic!</font>

272
00:10:57,220 --> 00:10:58,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll get us through this!</font>

273
00:10:58,511 --> 00:11:00,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

274
00:11:00,095 --> 00:11:02,845
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan, we're moving
the stuff off the door!</font>

275
00:11:02,887 --> 00:11:04,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just hang on!</font>

276
00:11:04,303 --> 00:11:06,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's real good, honey!
Keep your spirits up!</font>

277
00:11:06,137 --> 00:11:07,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm coming!</font>

278
00:11:09,887 --> 00:11:11,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">There, there,
you're safe now.</font>

279
00:11:15,637 --> 00:11:17,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">The wigs!
They're all gone!</font>

280
00:11:17,261 --> 00:11:20,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Half of those belonged
to Brendan Fraser!</font>

281
00:11:21,012 --> 00:11:23,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, thank the stars you made it!</font>

282
00:11:23,303 --> 00:11:24,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come here, I've got you!</font>

283
00:11:24,470 --> 00:11:25,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, bless you, Roger!</font>

284
00:11:26,012 --> 00:11:27,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was afraid I…</font>

285
00:11:27,678 --> 00:11:29,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank God
this one survived.</font>

286
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can still go
to cowboy weddings.</font>

287
00:11:31,970 --> 00:11:33,762
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Nein!</i></font>

288
00:11:36,428 --> 00:11:38,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, one at a time.</font>

289
00:11:38,470 --> 00:11:40,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">The rope isn't very strong.</font>

290
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:42,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't want
to die here!</font>

291
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:44,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm supposed to die
in the medical tent</font>

292
00:11:44,970 --> 00:11:46,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">at a music festival!</font>

293
00:11:47,678 --> 00:11:49,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jeff, no!</font>

294
00:11:49,095 --> 00:11:50,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ow!</font>

295
00:11:50,511 --> 00:11:52,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jeff! Now we
lost our rope!</font>

296
00:11:52,054 --> 00:11:55,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm so sorry!</font>

297
00:11:55,179 --> 00:11:57,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get ahold of yourself!</font>

298
00:12:00,511 --> 00:12:02,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh.</font>

299
00:12:04,054 --> 00:12:05,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh.</font>

300
00:12:06,470 --> 00:12:08,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">How are we gonna
get up there now?</font>

301
00:12:08,095 --> 00:12:09,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get us out
of here, Mrs. S!</font>

302
00:12:09,845 --> 00:12:11,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!
I'll save us!</font>

303
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:12,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">We, uh… we should…</font>

304
00:12:12,637 --> 00:12:15,178
<font color="#FFFFFF">open a window
and flood this floor!</font>

305
00:12:15,179 --> 00:12:17,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">The rising water will carry us
right up to the living room.</font>

306
00:12:17,678 --> 00:12:20,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's no way we're doing
another one of your ideas, Stan!</font>

307
00:12:23,470 --> 00:12:25,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe we should.</font>

308
00:12:25,261 --> 00:12:26,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

309
00:12:26,845 --> 00:12:28,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">Look, I know Dad's decisions
haven't worked out,</font>

310
00:12:28,637 --> 00:12:30,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">but he is trying.</font>

311
00:12:30,637 --> 00:12:31,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">I say we open
the window…</font>

312
00:12:33,220 --> 00:12:36,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">unless anyone
has a better idea…</font>

313
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:37,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">based in reality.</font>

314
00:12:38,261 --> 00:12:40,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, then.
Window it is.</font>

315
00:12:40,054 --> 00:12:41,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank you, Hayley.</font>

316
00:12:41,095 --> 00:12:42,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're welcome, Dad.</font>

317
00:12:47,762 --> 00:12:49,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Aah!</font>

318
00:12:49,553 --> 00:12:52,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad was wrong…</font>

319
00:12:52,595 --> 00:12:55,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wow, what a beautiful creature.</font>

320
00:12:55,303 --> 00:12:57,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">And we know so
little about them.</font>

321
00:13:03,095 --> 00:13:04,080
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hayley!
Hayley!</font>

322
00:13:04,095 --> 00:13:05,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, God! Oh, God!</font>

323
00:13:05,553 --> 00:13:07,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">That shark's in here, man!</font>

324
00:13:07,511 --> 00:13:10,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">If they're really attracted
to blood, then it's in my room,</font>

325
00:13:10,179 --> 00:13:13,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">attacking the boxers I wore
the day Francine made tacos.</font>

326
00:13:13,762 --> 00:13:15,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just leave me behind!</font>

327
00:13:15,345 --> 00:13:17,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">I am bad in a crisis.</font>

328
00:13:17,054 --> 00:13:18,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">And it got Hayley killed!</font>

329
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't give up, Dad.</font>

330
00:13:20,220 --> 00:13:22,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">We got the window closed
and we'll find her.</font>

331
00:13:24,553 --> 00:13:27,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's the ghost of Hayley risen
up from the depths of hell!</font>

332
00:13:27,553 --> 00:13:29,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">She has unfinished
business with me!</font>

333
00:13:29,345 --> 00:13:30,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">Leave me be, specter!</font>

334
00:13:30,637 --> 00:13:32,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, she's alive!</font>

335
00:13:32,553 --> 00:13:35,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why would you assume
she went to hell?</font>

336
00:13:35,054 --> 00:13:37,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hayley?</font>

337
00:13:37,845 --> 00:13:40,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's on the bottom
of your mattress, Steve?</font>

338
00:13:40,929 --> 00:13:44,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">So many of the girls
are Asian, and pregnant.</font>

339
00:13:44,054 --> 00:13:45,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">She's not in here,
we should keep moving.</font>

340
00:13:49,095 --> 00:13:50,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shark!</font>

341
00:13:50,553 --> 00:13:51,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, thank god.
It's just a dead girl.</font>

342
00:13:53,054 --> 00:13:55,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger, you came back for me.</font>

343
00:13:55,637 --> 00:13:57,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh, okay.</font>

344
00:13:57,386 --> 00:14:01,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you want to come to dinner
at my parents' house on Tuesday?</font>

345
00:14:01,803 --> 00:14:04,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">What did you find?
I-Is it Hayley?</font>

346
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:06,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, it's nothing.
Just a cushion.</font>

347
00:14:06,261 --> 00:14:10,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're going to have
lots of babies.</font>

348
00:14:10,386 --> 00:14:13,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, no, no, no, no, no.</font>

349
00:14:13,095 --> 00:14:15,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">She's not in
here, either.</font>

350
00:14:16,012 --> 00:14:17,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where's your father?</font>

351
00:14:17,345 --> 00:14:18,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">The shark
got him!</font>

352
00:14:18,970 --> 00:14:20,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan! Hayley!</font>

353
00:14:20,845 --> 00:14:23,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't see any…</font>

354
00:14:24,303 --> 00:14:25,205
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hayley!</font>

355
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:27,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">Careful!</font>

356
00:14:27,179 --> 00:14:30,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">The shark let me go when I
jammed my one-hitter in its eye,</font>

357
00:14:30,511 --> 00:14:32,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">but I think it's
still here somewhere.</font>

358
00:14:41,803 --> 00:14:43,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hang on, Hayley.</font>

359
00:14:43,179 --> 00:14:44,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mama's coming.</font>

360
00:14:49,762 --> 00:14:52,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Does anyone have ChapStick?</font>

361
00:14:53,970 --> 00:14:55,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got you, honey.</font>

362
00:14:55,511 --> 00:14:56,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's okay…</font>

363
00:14:58,553 --> 00:15:00,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Go, go, go!</font>

364
00:15:05,637 --> 00:15:06,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have to go up!</font>

365
00:15:15,345 --> 00:15:16,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">We did it!</font>

366
00:15:16,511 --> 00:15:18,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">We got away.</font>

367
00:15:18,678 --> 00:15:20,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, according
to the blueprints…</font>

368
00:15:22,345 --> 00:15:25,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's hungry for flesh
<i>and</i> knowledge!</font>

369
00:15:29,345 --> 00:15:30,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't look at me, whore!</font>

370
00:15:30,637 --> 00:15:32,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">We both know what this is!</font>

371
00:15:32,678 --> 00:15:33,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's love!</font>

372
00:15:34,012 --> 00:15:35,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Forever love!</font>

373
00:15:39,678 --> 00:15:40,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan! Oh.</font>

374
00:15:41,012 --> 00:15:43,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">Didn't see you there.</font>

375
00:15:43,428 --> 00:15:47,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sneaky. A sneaky
boy is what you are.</font>

376
00:15:47,386 --> 00:15:50,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">Francine was right
about me, Klaus.</font>

377
00:15:50,054 --> 00:15:52,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">The farther away from the family
I am, the safer they'll be.</font>

378
00:15:52,970 --> 00:15:54,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">- There he is!
- There he is!</font>

379
00:15:54,595 --> 00:15:55,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Look at all his teeth!</font>

380
00:15:56,012 --> 00:15:57,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">They don't sound
very safe, Stan.</font>

381
00:15:57,386 --> 00:15:58,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">You'd better
get in there!</font>

382
00:15:58,678 --> 00:16:01,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want to, but I'll only
make things worse</font>

383
00:16:01,054 --> 00:16:02,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">- with my bad decisions.
- Aah, look!</font>

384
00:16:02,803 --> 00:16:05,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">Look, Stan, everyone
makes bad decisions,</font>

385
00:16:05,678 --> 00:16:07,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">but it's a numbers game.</font>

386
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:10,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eventually, you're bound
to make the right call.</font>

387
00:16:10,511 --> 00:16:11,496
<font color="#FFFFFF">I am?</font>

388
00:16:11,511 --> 00:16:12,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sure.</font>

389
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:13,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Look at Nicolas Cage.</font>

390
00:16:14,012 --> 00:16:16,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">He made many horrible movies.</font>

391
00:16:16,054 --> 00:16:18,220
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Snake Eyes, 8MM,</i></font>

392
00:16:18,261 --> 00:16:19,762
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Gone in Sixty Seconds,</i></font>

393
00:16:19,803 --> 00:16:21,261
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Captain Corelli's Mandolin,
Windtalkers…</i></font>

394
00:16:22,428 --> 00:16:24,012
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>…Ghost Rider, Family Man,</i></font>

395
00:16:24,054 --> 00:16:26,553
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Weather Man, Wicker Man,
Bangkok Dangerous.</i></font>

396
00:16:26,595 --> 00:16:28,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's his fin!</font>

397
00:16:28,303 --> 00:16:31,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">But then he nailed it, Stan,
with <i>National Treasure Two,</i></font>

398
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:34,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">the greatest movie of all time!</font>

399
00:16:34,303 --> 00:16:36,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">He did nail it!</font>

400
00:16:36,220 --> 00:16:40,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">He nailed it so hard that he
<i>became</i> a national treasure…</font>

401
00:16:40,637 --> 00:16:42,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">- too.
- Mom, behind you!</font>

402
00:16:42,637 --> 00:16:44,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">My God!</font>

403
00:16:44,595 --> 00:16:47,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">If Nicolas Cage can recover
from his bad decisions</font>

404
00:16:47,845 --> 00:16:50,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">and make a great one,
so can I!</font>

405
00:16:50,095 --> 00:16:51,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's the spirit.</font>

406
00:16:51,179 --> 00:16:53,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to save my family!</font>

407
00:16:56,345 --> 00:16:59,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">And this time, I'm going
to make the right call.</font>

408
00:16:59,345 --> 00:17:01,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't want
to die yet.</font>

409
00:17:01,803 --> 00:17:03,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't experienced
the disappointment</font>

410
00:17:03,637 --> 00:17:05,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">of being in a monogamous
sexual relationship.</font>

411
00:17:07,261 --> 00:17:08,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Help has arrived!</font>

412
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:11,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's okay.</font>

413
00:17:11,970 --> 00:17:14,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">I let the bear in
to kill the shark.</font>

414
00:17:14,179 --> 00:17:16,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're natural enemies
since the dawn of time.</font>

415
00:17:22,137 --> 00:17:23,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're working in tandem!</font>

416
00:17:23,762 --> 00:17:25,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're brothers in arms!</font>

417
00:17:27,970 --> 00:17:29,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just a hiccup. Don't worry.</font>

418
00:17:29,762 --> 00:17:31,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm Nic Caging this mother!</font>

419
00:17:34,137 --> 00:17:36,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">This time, I'll
make the right call.</font>

420
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm gonna electrocute them!</font>

421
00:17:38,511 --> 00:17:40,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Stan, I don't think…</font>

422
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:42,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Aah!</font>

423
00:17:54,012 --> 00:17:55,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't worry. I'm on this.</font>

424
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time, I'm bound
to make the right call.</font>

425
00:17:57,803 --> 00:17:59,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're killing us, Mr. S!</font>

426
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stop it!
Stay calm, Jeff!</font>

427
00:18:01,345 --> 00:18:02,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll get us
through this.</font>

428
00:18:02,970 --> 00:18:04,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">You have to let…
me…</font>

429
00:18:04,678 --> 00:18:05,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">help… you!</font>

430
00:18:06,012 --> 00:18:08,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Stan!
- I know, honey.</font>

431
00:18:08,345 --> 00:18:09,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">You believe
in me again.</font>

432
00:18:09,386 --> 00:18:11,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!</font>

433
00:18:11,345 --> 00:18:13,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're making everything
much, much worse!</font>

434
00:18:13,220 --> 00:18:15,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now look me in the eyes.</font>

435
00:18:15,137 --> 00:18:18,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to tell you
exactly what to do.</font>

436
00:18:18,511 --> 00:18:21,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">You need to go out and get help.</font>

437
00:18:21,386 --> 00:18:24,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">No more decisions
or ideas.</font>

438
00:18:24,054 --> 00:18:27,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">Go outside and get help, okay?</font>

439
00:18:27,678 --> 00:18:28,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, I hear you.</font>

440
00:18:29,012 --> 00:18:30,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">I really do.</font>

441
00:18:30,470 --> 00:18:32,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I'm not going to do that.</font>

442
00:18:32,261 --> 00:18:33,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because I have a better idea.</font>

443
00:18:33,970 --> 00:18:37,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">My old college javelin.</font>

444
00:18:37,261 --> 00:18:40,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">Remember?</font>

445
00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:41,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll harpoon the bear,</font>

446
00:18:41,845 --> 00:18:44,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the bear blood will distract
the shark, and we can escape!</font>

447
00:18:44,470 --> 00:18:46,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan!</font>

448
00:18:48,303 --> 00:18:49,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!</font>

449
00:18:54,137 --> 00:18:55,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!</font>

450
00:19:03,386 --> 00:19:05,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ow!</font>

451
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:15,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry about tranquilizing you,
Stan.</font>

452
00:19:15,678 --> 00:19:18,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">I-I wasn't sure who was doing
the most damage down there.</font>

453
00:19:18,428 --> 00:19:19,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's okay.</font>

454
00:19:19,845 --> 00:19:21,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">You did the
right thing,
Buckle.</font>

455
00:19:21,678 --> 00:19:24,553
<font color="#FFFFFF">You harpooned me.</font>

456
00:19:24,595 --> 00:19:27,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">I told you to go out
and get help…</font>

457
00:19:27,261 --> 00:19:29,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you harpooned me.</font>

458
00:19:29,511 --> 00:19:31,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm so sorry, Francine.</font>

459
00:19:31,386 --> 00:19:34,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just wanted to prove
I'm good in a crisis.</font>

460
00:19:34,428 --> 00:19:36,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">I failed.</font>

461
00:19:36,220 --> 00:19:41,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan, 99% of the time,
there is no crisis,</font>

462
00:19:41,303 --> 00:19:44,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you're a wonderful
husband and father.</font>

463
00:19:44,511 --> 00:19:46,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">But what about
when there is one?</font>

464
00:19:46,261 --> 00:19:48,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's the man's job
to protect his family.</font>

465
00:19:48,803 --> 00:19:50,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">And you <i>can, honey…</i></font>

466
00:19:50,637 --> 00:19:53,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">by getting the hell out
of the way and doing nothing.</font>

467
00:19:53,762 --> 00:19:56,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh. Do nothing.</font>

468
00:19:58,012 --> 00:20:01,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">Francine, we both know
I'm not going to do that.</font>

469
00:20:01,678 --> 00:20:04,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">I wonder how much damage
the hurricane did</font>

470
00:20:04,054 --> 00:20:05,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">to the neighborhood.</font>

471
00:20:10,678 --> 00:20:12,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, what a day.</font>

472
00:20:12,220 --> 00:20:13,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tell me about it.</font>

473
00:20:13,511 --> 00:20:15,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't even know
where the hell I am.</font>

474
00:20:15,511 --> 00:20:18,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">Looter!
Self defense!</font>

475
00:20:18,345 --> 00:20:20,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">A black and a white talking
as if it's normal!</font>

476
00:20:21,929 --> 00:20:23,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">Peter, what
are you doing?</font>

477
00:20:23,511 --> 00:20:24,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know me!</font>

478
00:20:24,845 --> 00:20:26,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everybody shut up
and let me think!</font>

479
00:20:26,428 --> 00:20:27,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just let me think!</font>

480
00:20:27,762 --> 00:20:28,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan,
have you…?</font>

481
00:20:31,179 --> 00:20:34,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, man. Classic
<i>American Dad.</i></font>

